  unikraft images list [<target> ...] [flags]

Arguments:
  [<target> ...]
          Target images to list.

Examples:
  # List all images
  unikraft image list

  # Filter images by reference
  unikraft image list --filter 'ref~="/nginx"'

Fields:
  ref
  digest
  namespace

